@startuml
title UmbraRo, request flow behind the Match Analysis sheet

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam defaultFontName Inter

actor "Coach" as U
participant "UmbraRo app\n(Flutter)" as App
participant "FastAPI backend\n(App Runner)" as API
participant "CatBoost + optimiser" as ML
participant "XI predictor" as XI

== Dashboard load (weekly fixtures, cached) ==
U -> App : open dashboard
App -> API : GET /week-fixtures
API -> ML : baseline P(win) + SHAP drivers
ML --> API : calibrated probability + drivers
API -> ML : optimise (Monte Carlo, N = 25,000)
ML --> API : optimised P + blueprint
API --> App : fixtures + probability + drivers + blueprint\n(cached ~6 h)

== Open the Match Analysis sheet (on tap) ==
U -> App : tap a fixture
alt upcoming fixture
  App -> XI : GET recommended XI
  XI --> App : recommended starting eleven
else completed fixture
  App -> API : GET match details
  API --> App : official stats + real lineups\n(cached 24 h)
end
App --> U : render panels
@enduml
